-- RLS tenant isolation batch: enable + policy + force for tables with tenant_id
-- that were not covered by startup RLS bootstrap.
-- Owner: topems_app (app user). Executed via DATABASE_URL.
-- Excluded (global system tables, all rows tenant_id NULL, no tenant semantics):
